  "identity": "Black-green reanimator-sacrifice going over the top. Green ramp (Birds of Paradise, Nature's Lore, Werebear) powers out the black recursion engines, and free sacrifice outlets (Phyrexian Ghoul, Phyrexian Debaser, Dread Return's flashback) fill the graveyard with oversized creatures. Reanimation then rebuys them — Oversold Cemetery returns one every upkeep, Chainer reanimates from any yard, Gamekeeper digs a fatty straight into play when it dies, and Body Snatcher / Life // Death / Dread Return recur bombs cheaply. The deck wins the long game by attacking with an inevitable stream of large bodies (Spiritmonger, Symbiotic Beast's tokens, recurring Necrosavant) that replace themselves when sacrificed.",
